WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:06.614
Denmark's deepfake bill exempts satire. When
the powerful go to court over a joke, who wins?

00:00:07.564 --> 00:00:13.043
1831, Paris: a king. The court sided with
the king.

00:00:13.993 --> 00:00:19.471
1988: a TV preacher and a parody ad. The
court sided with satire.

00:00:20.421 --> 00:00:25.900
2024, AI fakes. Berlin: the government
won. California: satire won.

00:00:26.750 --> 00:00:32.479
Two all since 1831. Denmark is the next
match.
